    <string name="thread_tips_direct_body">Swipe right on a message bubble to reply.\n\nLong-press a message to react, copy, share, delete it from this device, or start selecting multiple messages.\n\nTap a quoted reply or a reply count chip to jump around a reply thread.\n\nThe composer now grows for longer drafts and captions while keeping the send button anchored.\n\nWhen selection mode is active, tap more bubbles and use the action bar to copy, share, or delete them from this device.</string>
    <string name="thread_tips_group_body">Swipe right on a group message bubble to reply.\n\nLong-press a message to react, copy, share, delete it from this device, or start selecting multiple messages.\n\nTap a quoted reply or a reply count chip to jump around a reply thread.\n\nUse Attach Media to send photos, videos, audio, or documents to the group, then open Shared Media from group info later.\n\nThe composer now grows for longer drafts while keeping the send button anchored.\n\nWhen selection mode is active, tap more bubbles and use the action bar to copy, share, or delete them from this device.</string>
